FINAL TEXT Reel done. Master at `anthropics/claude-code-101/02-plan-rewind-subagents/cc-writer-reviewer-pattern/cc-writer-reviewer-pattern.mp4` — 3840×2160, 4:10, 12 beats.

**What was built.** Three real headless Claude Code sessions on a small `pass_fail.py` grader with an ambiguous ask and a `grades.csv` with three deliberately awkward rows. Same-context review (via `--resume`) framed every finding as "I picked / I never asked" — six paragraphs opening with "I", zero line cites. Clean-context review (fresh `--session-id` in a folder with only the four files) led with **Real bugs**, three numbered findings, three line cites, and re-derived Cai's flipped average (89 → 59.3) from the CSV. Same model, same weights — different starting context, different question asked.

**Gates.** GATE T PASS, content-check PASS, frame-check PASS, lane-check PASS, GATE AUDIO PASS. Two non-blocking advisories: BVDT §8.10 0.84 (verdict beat is designed to recite the artifact) and SKIN LINT on B00 (CCSession cold open is explicitly permitted by the cc-explainer SKILL).

**Not published.** Master stays in the reel folder; `CC-BUILT.txt` written into the concept folder. Supervisor starts the next.
